WEBVTT

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:50.580
THE DRAGON KNIGHT

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:57.220
I'll draw it away to give you time!

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:58.600
O-Okay!

00:01:58.600 --> 00:01:59.470
Come on!

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.520
Everybody hurry!

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:23.330
What happened?!

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:26.750
Oh no!

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.330
Everybody help!

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.090
Yeah, but...

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:32.500
Hurry up with you!

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.090
You can lift a rock, can't you?!

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:35.800
Go!

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:37.800
R-Right!

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:46.940
<i>Dragon scales are as hard as steel.</i>

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:49.690
<i>I'll have to target its faces!</i>

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:59.070
Earth Slash!

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:09.750
Dai!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:12.370
Crack!

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.090
Even its faces are like steel?!

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:21.340
His sword wore down.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:40.690
I can't win, fighting them one by one.

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:45.240
For this, I'll take them all out
with a single huge spell!

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:53.080
Mighty spirits asleep in the earth,
I now ask you to hear my voice!

00:03:58.300 --> 00:03:59.460
Donk!

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:13.810
Yes!

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:19.150
Ouch...

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:24.740
Wow. I guess that's a spell straight from
Grand Sorcerer Matoriv for you.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:29.080
But it used up all of my Magic Power
in the process.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:36.710
Frizz! Frizz!

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:44.510
With puny spells like that...

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.680
He can't win!

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:48.180
I know! Give that to the boy!

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:51.520
What are you saying?! This is mine!

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:00.610
Dai!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.360
Look!

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.820
Green Dragons!

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:13.370
Princess, sorry! You've got to run!

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:17.500
Ow!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:20.250
Run?! How can we run?!

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.670
We're out of time!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:30.220
Don't leave me!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.100
What a bunch of cowards!

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:38.730
No!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:40.860
They're done for!

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.530
Leona!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:13.850
Dai?

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.980
That crest! It can't be!

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:29.150
Boom!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:38.660
It's the mark!
We've got the advantage now!

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:47.630
Get out of here!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:07.280
Grandmother, that crest is...

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:08.150
Huh?

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:13.370
I never thought I'd see it for myself.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:17.200
The legendary Dragon Knight in battle!

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:46.440
Dai's even more intense than usual today.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.900
Popp, help us out!

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.150
R-Right!

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:53.990
Hey!

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:31.990
Zapple!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.670
He won.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:51.670
Oh wow!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:56.260
Good going, Dai! That was amazing!

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.640
Are you okay?

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.060
U-Uh...

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:06.310
What's wrong?

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:09.270
I'm scared! He's scary!

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:10.690
Huh?

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.490
I'm... scary?

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:23.410
W-Why is everybody...

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.500
<i>Because you're not human.</i>

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:36.140
<i>Seeing your inhuman fighting abilities
has terrified them all.</i>

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:37.140
Who's there?!

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:43.350
<i>Humans can be so selfish.
And after you protected their city.</i>

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:45.480
There!

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:52.070
The Dark Army?!

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:57.240
My name is Killvearn.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:04.160
My rather insulting friends
call me "the Reaper."

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:08.170
Killvearn, the Reaper?!

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:11.130
Are you the Dragon Legion Commander?!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:16.050
I'm not that distinguished.
I'm just a servant.

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:20.720
The Dark Army has been abuzz,
speculating on your identity.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:27.140
So I was lent some Dragons from the
Dragon Legion and was sent to find out.

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:33.520
As a result, I was able to see
what you really are.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.490
Wait! What do you mean by that?!

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:45.330
Oh, also, the real Dragon Legion
Commander will probably show up soon...

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:48.790
to lure you into hell.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.710
Hope you enjoy it.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:55.920
He's gone.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:06.020
What did he mean by... my identity?

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:12.820
Wait. You called Dai
"the Dragon Knight," didn't you?

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:13.860
Indeed.

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:20.700
He must be the Dragon Knight from the
legends of our homeland, Teran Kingdom.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.870
Huh? The Dragon Knight?

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:26.290
Where's Teran? And who are you?

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:30.040
I am Nabara the Seer.
And this is my granddaughter, Merle.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:35.250
It's a country north of Bengarna.
It's called the Mystic Country.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.630
<i>The Mystic Country.</i>

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:39.760
<i>If I go there...</i>

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:45.600
AVAN STRASH

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.600
CRACKLE
ICE-TYPE SPELL

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:59.070
<i>Sovereign Rock Castle's
footprints end here.</i>

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:03.740
<i>The Field of Death...</i>

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:09.330
<i>Dark King Vearn's Dark Army
must be positioned there.</i>

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:11.290
Who's there?!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:16.750
Are you alright?!

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.170
Th-The Dark Army.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:20.920
What?!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:26.050
The Dark Army drove
my homeland of Carl to ruin.

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:31.810
<i>Taking down Carl
couldn't have been an easy task.</i>

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:35.520
<i>Which Legion did it?</i>

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:42.110
So this is Teran Kingdom?

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.110
It's so pretty.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.070
Yeah, but...

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:52.040
it's kind of shabby.
It's more of a village than a kingdom.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:58.960
Uh, but, you know, I'm glad
the Dark Army hasn't attacked this place.

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:04.010
To be blunt, it's because
it has no tactical value.

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:09.000
Teran is a kingdom in name only.
It has no military power.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:10.010
Indeed.

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:14.440
Because of his love for nature
and devotion to the gods,

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:18.270
the king forbade development
of weapons and items.

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:22.070
He said they would bring disaster upon us.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:27.320
But that also weakened the country.

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:30.960
Everybody prefers
a life filled with luxury.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:37.080
The population moved to other countries,
and this country was left to rot.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:44.340
Now there are only about 50 people.
Of course, we were among those who left.

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:46.130
But...

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:49.930
I still love this quiet homeland.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:54.190
She's a strange one.

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:57.440
Madam Nabara, please tell me!

00:13:57.440 --> 00:14:01.610
Where can I find something
that will tell me who I am?!

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:05.200
Whoa. What are you
getting worked up about, Dai?

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:07.030
I'm not worked up!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:08.950
Dai...

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.870
I'm sorry.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:16.790
But, I have to know! Just who I am!

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.130
Follow me.

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:29.930
Talk about decrepit. Is this some ruin?

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.260
Look inside.

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:34.680
That's...

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.440
That is the Dragon Crest.

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:40.360
Is this the mark
that appears on my forehead?

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:42.020
Yes. It's identical.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:45.360
Teran worships the God of Dragons.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:52.320
And this crest is revered and feared
as a sign of the God of Dragons' power.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:56.160
He who bears this crest
on his forehead is...

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.580
The Dragon Knight?

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.920
What sort of human is it?

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:03.090
It may not be human at all.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:09.430
<i>We believe it is a servant of the gods.</i>

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.640
<i>According to legends,</i>

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:17.690
<i>the Dragon Knight wields awesome power,
can cast any spell,</i>

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:23.230
<i>and, with the heavens, earth, and sea
as its allies, will destroy all creation.</i>

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.780
What kind of being destroys all creation?

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:37.620
It could be our savior or our destroyer.

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:45.040
It is only written that it wields power
like a rebirth of the God of Dragons.

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:46.300
However...

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:48.130
However what?!

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:55.470
There is a forbidden temple
at the bottom of this lake.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:58.890
The soul of the God of Dragons
is said to rest there.

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:00.980
Then...

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:06.270
Indeed. If you really do have something
to do with the Dragon Knight,

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:11.900
perhaps you can enter that temple
and find some clues.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:16.280
I'm... going down there.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:19.210
An underwater temple, huh? Okay!

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:20.330
I'm going alone.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.460
Huh?

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.500
But... shouldn't we all go?

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:28.210
No. I want to go alone.

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:30.710
Dai...

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:33.800
All right. At least take this.

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:35.760
I bought it in Bengarna.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.350
Okay. Thanks.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:44.810
I've never wondered who I am before.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:50.780
I washed up on Dermline Island
as a baby and was raised among monsters.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:55.700
Grampa Brass scolded me a lot,
but he cared for me.

00:16:55.700 --> 00:17:01.200
The monsters never excluded me
just because I wasn't a monster.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:09.130
But humans won't accept me
unless I'm also a human.

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:12.420
That's why...

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:15.260
I want to find out alone.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.140
I...

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.640
I don't want you or Leona to hate me!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:21.980
Dai!

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:23.480
Wait!

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.980
Dai!

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.690
You idiot!

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:37.280
Worrying about things that don't matter!

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:42.410
I thought we were friends!
I thought we were companions!

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:51.920
I don't care if you're a monster or not!

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:56.630
That... never mattered!

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:00.800
Popp...

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:28.370
<i>So this is...</i>

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:31.210
<i>the Dragon Temple.</i>

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.050
<i>How do I get inside?</i>

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:54.320
There's air in here.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:20.090
<i>Who goes there?</i>

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:21.930
<i>Name yourself.</i>

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:24.220
A talking crystal?!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:28.640
<i>I am the Dragon Crystal.
Guardian of this temple.</i>

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:30.480
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:34.690
That's what I want to know!
Am I really a Dragon Knight?!

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:38.110
<i>Why do you ask this?</i>

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:42.660
I don't know
where I was born or who I am!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.330
Tell me!

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:46.370
<i>There is no mistake.</i>

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:49.200
<i>You are the Dragon Knight.</i>

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.000
Th-Then it's true.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:55.630
<i>This temple cannot be entered
by anyone but the Dragon Knight.</i>

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:58.920
<i>Your presence here is proof itself.</i>

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:04.010
Just what is a Dragon Knight?!

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:06.770
Is it a human or a monster?

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:08.600
<i>It is neither.</i>

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:12.730
<i>Three gods created this world.</i>

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:16.740
<i>The God of Dragons, the God of Darklings,
and the God of Humans.</i>

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:22.280
<i>The Dragon Knight is the ultimate creature
created by those three gods.</i>

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:24.200
Created?!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:28.620
<i>Yes. Long ago,
by three great celestial beings.</i>

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.460
Why create such a creature?

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:32.460
<i>To...</i>

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:35.420
What's wrong?!

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:39.250
<i>Someone else has entered this temple.</i>

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:48.430
<i>This is impossible. The Dragon Knight...</i>

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:52.980
Who are you?!

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.400
The Dragon Legion Commander...

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:05.240
Baran!

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.120
Baran?!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:13.830
<i>So he's the Dragon Legion Commander.</i>

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.540
<i>He's the real deal!</i>

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:20.340
<i>And there's something about him...</i>

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:21.710
You must be Dai.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:22.760
That's right!

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:26.050
<i>This man is also a Dragon Knight?!</i>

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:31.470
<i>Impossible. Two Dragon Knights
existing in the same age...</i>

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:33.930
Are you here to kill me?!

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:35.610
No I'm not.

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:36.440
Huh?!

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:43.030
The Dragon Crystal must have already
told you that you're a Dragon Knight.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:45.070
So what if it did?!

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:48.410
I want your power.

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:51.450
Serve me!

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:54.460
Together we shall destroy...

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:56.460
the human world!

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:25.940
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:25.940
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:46.670
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:46.670
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:52.810
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:52.810
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:57.480
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:57.480
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:01.690
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:01.690
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:08.150
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:08.150
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:13.990
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:13.990
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:19.290
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:19.290
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:39.020
<i>Baran, the Dragon Legion Commander
reveals the Dragon Knight's mission.</i>

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:44.190
<i>For Dai, who seeks to defeat
the Dark King, it is a cruel revelation.</i>

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:49.610
<i>Dai resists, using his Avan Strash,
but it has no effect on Baran.</i>

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:53.620
<i>Baran then reveals a shocking truth...</i>

00:23:54.070 --> 00:23:56.370
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:56.540 --> 00:23:58.080
<i>"Dragon Master General Baran"</i>

00:23:58.250 --> 00:24:00.040
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
